# ============================================================
# AI-SAGA Server — .gitignore
# Protects operational secrets and user data from being committed.
# DESIGN.md and main.py are intentionally NOT ignored (public showcase).
# ============================================================

# ---- Secrets / credentials / signing material ----
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*.p8
*.cer
*.mobileprovision
*.jks
*.keystore
secrets.*
credentials.*
id_rsa
id_ed25519
token_secret*

# ---- Runtime data / databases (contain user & device data) ----
data/
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm

# ---- 技术核心机密：大纲"故事底稿"模板（含层层"几选一"），绝不提交仓库 ----
# 内容见 server/data/the_script_framework.txt（服务器 /code/data，单独部署）。
# 单独列一行做双保险：即使上面 data/ 规则被改动，该机密文件也不会被 add/commit。
data/the_script_framework.txt

# ---- Python ----
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.venv/
venv/
*.log

# ---- Misc ----
.DS_Store
